*.log
# Runtime state that lives in the checkout: DSH session logs (prompts, tool output,
# attachments) and pnpm's content-addressable store. Neither belongs in an image:
# the store alone reached 1.4 GB in a working checkout, and session logs are user
# data that must never be published.
.sessions
**/.sessions
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
mdl/.runtime
mdl/validation
graphify-out
**/graphify-out
